  {
   "title": "The LaunchPad and the panel, no cable in",
   "text": "The LP-EM-CC35X1 with its Wi-Fi antenna at the top and no cable in, and the Waveshare 3.5 inch panel beside it, its 15-way connector toward the board. No power until the last wire is in.",
   "focus": "cc35x1.mcu",
