    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Power: two wires, 3.3 V only",
   "text": "Panel VCC to J1 pin 1 (3V3) and panel GND to J2 pin 20 (GND). Plug each wire onto the same pin position on the pack's top headers. The panel's pin 2 (3V3) stays empty, and nothing here touches a 5 V pin.",
