      "vcc",
      "gnd"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "check": "Red on J1 pin 1 (3V3), black on J2 pin 20 (GND). Nothing on the 5V pin beside 3V3."
  },
  {
   "title": "The screen bus: clock, data and chip select",
   "text": "SCLK to J1 pin 4 (GPIO17), MOSI to J4 pin 38 (GPIO19), MISO to J1 pin 3 (GPIO18) and LCD_CS to J4 pin 37 (GPIO16). MISO is optional: it only reads the panel ID back at start.",
