  },
  {
   "title": "Screen control: data or command, backlight, reset",
   "text": "LCD_DC to J2 pin 18 (GPIO26), LCD_BL to J1 pin 8 (GPIO14), LCD_RST to J3 pin 30 (GPIO31). Pin 30 also runs to the pack's J5 jumper, so keep J5 on SPI DAC.",
